# License - worlds/sample-world (Emberfield)

This sample world pack is dedicated to the public domain under
[Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

You can copy, modify, distribute, and use this pack for any purpose,
without asking permission. Where practical, attribution to "vefr
sample-world (Emberfield), by Rylee Hulgan" is appreciated but not
required.

Why CC0: this is the engine's *playable demo* — a fresh public
VEFR checkout gives people a world they can run, modify, or replace.
Locking it under copyleft would make "replace everything" less
honest.

If you build something inspired by Emberfield and want to share it
under a copyleft license (e.g. CC BY-SA), you are welcome to do
so; nothing here requires it.
